    "style-research-extended vol.3 — finding 7: two archetypes this volume says are missing, `bop` (Sicko Mobb, DLow — faster than drill, backbeat back on 2 & 4, so `chicago-drill` explicitly declined it)",
    "style-research-extended vol.3 chicago-drill — roster table: Chicago **bop**, the fast, bright, Auto-Tuned counter-scene, notated ~150–165 with the backbeat back on 2 & 4 [LOW-CONF]",
    "style-research-extended vol.3 chicago-drill — Assignment notes: \"Bop (Sicko Mobb, DLow) is not modelled here. It is a faster, brighter Chicago groove … and it needs its own genre model rather than a variant of this one\"",
    "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bop_(rap)"
